---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+16072289269";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (607) 228-9269";
---
<Layout title="Thermostat Repair Gastonia NC | Thermostat Replacement | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="Thermostat repair and upgrade in Gastonia, NC. Fix short-cycling, no response, and inaccurate readings. Call +1 (607) 228-9269.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services / Thermostat Repair</p>
      <h1>Thermostat Repair in Gastonia, NC</h1>
      <p>A faulty control interface causes short-cycling, temperature swings, and wasted energy. Often a fast, affordable fix.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>A faulty thermostat causes short-cycling, temperature swings, and wasted energy. <strong>Thermostat Repair</strong> or upgrade is one of the fastest ways to restore reliable comfort and lower your Duke Energy bill.</p>
      <p>We diagnose whether the problem is the thermostat itself, wiring, batteries, or a system issue that the thermostat is only reflecting. Compatible replacements — including programmable and smart thermostats — can be installed the same visit in many cases.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <p>Thermostat not responding or short-cycling?</p>
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
